<li><strong>Voltage drop.</strong> Systems expanded over the years without re-sizing cable, so the last fixtures on the run are dim and yellow while the first are bright.</li>
<li><strong>Grown-in landscaping.</strong> The system works perfectly; the agave is simply three feet taller than it was when the fixture was aimed.</li>
